%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: MasterText_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f72ed376cdb85bfd1a937dbe8c84c6d7, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1900000000
    m_Localized: "Enemy Soldiers"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000001
    m_Localized: "Defeat 10 enemy soldiers"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000002
    m_Localized: "Keep your distance and dodge dangerous attacks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000003
    m_Localized: "Try customizing your Kill Chords!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000004
    m_Localized: "Clear in 30 seconds or less"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000005
    m_Localized: "Clear in 60 seconds or less"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000006
    m_Localized: "Annihilation"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000007
    m_Localized: "Wipe out every soldier"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000008
    m_Localized: "Finish within 200 seconds"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000009
    m_Localized: "Finish within 180 seconds"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000010
    m_Localized: "Finish within 150 seconds"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000011
    m_Localized: "Survival"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000012
    m_Localized: "Survive the battlefield for 120 seconds"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000013
    m_Localized: "Area attacks like the Blue Attack can wipe out enemies fast!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000014
    m_Localized: "Take 50 damage or less"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000015
    m_Localized: "Take 75 damage or less"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000016
    m_Localized: "Take 25 damage or less"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000017
    m_Localized: "Tutorial"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000018
    m_Localized: "Learn the basic controls"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000019
    m_Localized: "Move with the stick (<size=24>{input.move}</size>)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000020
    m_Localized: "Movement and Dodging"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000021
    m_Localized: "Try dodging (<size=24>{input.dodge}</size>)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000022
    m_Localized: "Attacks"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000023
    m_Localized: "Types of Just Attacks"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000024
    m_Localized: "Try attacking (<size=24>{input.attack_button}</size>)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000025
    m_Localized: "Attack (<size=24>{input.attack_button}</size>) on the green timing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000026
    m_Localized: "Attack (<size=24>{input.attack_button}</size>) on the orange timing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000027
    m_Localized: "Attack (<size=24>{input.attack_button}</size>) on the blue timing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000028
    m_Localized: "Attack (<size=24>{input.attack_button}</size>) on the purple timing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000029
    m_Localized: "Now attack (<size=24>{input.attack_button}</size>) on the light blue timing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000030
    m_Localized: "Now attack (<size=24>{input.attack_button}</size>) on the yellow timing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000031
    m_Localized: "Kill Chords"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000032
    m_Localized: "Trigger a Kill Chord (<size=24>{input.attack_button}</size>)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000033
    m_Localized: "Defeat the enemies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000034
    m_Localized: "Time for the real thing. Put everything I've taught you to use and cut loose."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000035
    m_Localized: "First up, movement and dodging. You'll need them to get around the battlefield and slip past enemy fire, so keep them in mind."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000036
    m_Localized: "Next, your attacks. Each one has its own quirks, so get a solid feel for how they work."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000037
    m_Localized: "Last, your special ability: the Kill Chord. It's a unique power you unleash by playing phrases. Whether you can master it is up to you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000038
    m_Localized: "Got it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000039
    m_Localized: "Good. Moving on."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000040
    m_Localized: "Episode 1: \"ZeroDivide\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000041
    m_Localized: "On a client's orders, suppress the enemy forces occupying the ruined city."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000042
    m_Localized: "Stage 3\nWipe out the enemy horde and seize victory."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000043
    m_Localized: "Stage 1\nWipe out the enemy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000044
    m_Localized: "Scenario 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000045
    m_Localized: "Stage 2\nHold out against the enemy onslaught."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000046
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord 13"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000047
    m_Localized: "Deals {HitCount} hits at {DamageMultiplier} Attack to the targeted enemy.\n\nIf this attack lands a critical hit, its critical damage becomes {CriticalMultiplier}."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000048
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000049
    m_Localized: "A powerful single strike on the target with {DamageMultiplier} power.\n\nAlways lands a critical hit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000050
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord 3"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000051
    m_Localized: "Fires a single powerful piercing shot at the target with {DamageMultiplier} Attack.\nEnemies other than the target take {SecondaryDamageRate} of the original damage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000052
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord 8"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000053
    m_Localized: "Performs a triple-beat normal attack.\nThe enemy hit and every enemy within {InfectionRange} of it become Infected.\n(The effect ends after spreading {InfectionTriggerCount}.)\n\n[Infected]\nWhen an Infected enemy takes a hit, every Infected enemy takes {InfectionDamageRate} of the damage that enemy received.\nDamage dealt to other Infected enemies is judged the same way as a normal attack.\n(Critical and Just judgments apply, along with their multipliers.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000054
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord 5"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000055
    m_Localized: "Consumes {HealthCostRatio} of your HP, then deals (HP consumed × 10) × {DamageMultiplier} damage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000056
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord 10"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000057
    m_Localized: "Grants yourself a buff that reduces damage by {DamageReductionRate} for up to {DamageReductionHitCount}. (Does not stack.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000058
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord 9"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000059
    m_Localized: "For {DurationSeconds}, critical hits on enemies\ndeal {CriticalMultiplier} critical damage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000060
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord 2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000061
    m_Localized: "Fires the shotgun's normal attack,\nand applies a debuff that increases damage taken by {DamageTakenIncreaseRate} to the targets hit for {DurationSeconds}."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000062
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord 7"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000063
    m_Localized: "Attacks enemies in front of you {HitCount} times, applying a debuff that \"reduces the target's maximum Attack by {AttackPowerReductionRate}\".\nThen raises your Attack for {DurationSeconds} by the amount of Attack reduced × 10."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000064
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord 4"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000065
    m_Localized: "For {DurationSeconds}, gain {BarrierGainRate} of the damage you deal as overflow HP (barrier)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000066
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord 0"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000067
    m_Localized: "Deals a single hit at {DamageMultiplier} Attack to the targeted enemy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000068
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord 6"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000069
    m_Localized: "Grants yourself a buff: \"For {DurationSeconds}, recover {LifeStealRate} of the damage you deal as HP (cap per hit: {HealPerHitCap})\"."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000070
    m_Localized: "Attack  +6.25%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000071
    m_Localized: "Crit Damage  +10%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000072
    m_Localized: "Crit Rate  +2%\nCan be upgraded any number of times"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000073
    m_Localized: "Max HP  +6.25%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000074
    m_Localized: "Crit Rate  +2%"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000075
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord Effect\nPerforms a 4-beat normal attack\n3 times on enemies in a fan\nin front of you.\n\nTargets hit have their Attack\nreduced by up to 10% for 10 seconds.\nThen your Attack rises for 10 seconds\nby the amount of Attack reduced."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000076
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord Effect\nA single attack at 500% Attack\non the targeted enemy.\n\n\n\nKill Chord Effect\nFive attacks at 60% Attack\non the targeted enemy.\n\nIf this attack lands a critical hit,\nits damage is doubled.\n\n\nKill Chord Effect\nA powerful single strike on the target.\n\nAlways lands a critical hit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000077
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord Effect\n\nFor 5 seconds, gain a barrier equal to\n30% of the damage you deal."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000078
    m_Localized: "Unlocks one equipment slot.\n\nTips\nFrom four-wheel-drive cars and armored vehicles to tanks\nand gunships, she maintained and ran every vehicle\nall on her own,\nand served as the pilot on every operation.\nA talent no one could replace:\nthat was Subject 12.\nYet for all her gifts,\nshe was born as nothing more than\none of countless mass-produced units.\nEven so, to her,\nSymphony is still the sister\nclosest to her in age.\nThe armed uprising at the research facility.\nThat day, Symphony slipped out\nof the facility alone.\nThat one person alone knew in advance\nand helped her escape\nremains a secret\nbetween the two of them.\n\"For Symphony, I'd do\nanything. Just like back then.\"\nIs what she feels for the one she thinks of\nas her only little sister love, or something baser?\nShe probably hasn't realized it yet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000079
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord Effect\nA single high-power shot at the target.\n\nAfter hitting the target,\ndeals 50% of the Kill Chord's power\nto enemies on the line\nextending from the player through the enemy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000080
    m_Localized: "Max HP  +6.25%\nCan be upgraded any number of times"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000081
    m_Localized: "Area Attack Range  +0.3\nCan be upgraded any number of times"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000082
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord Effect\nConsumes n% of your HP\nand deals damage equal to the amount × m."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000083
    m_Localized: "Area Attack Range  +0.3"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000084
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord Effect\nFires the shotgun's normal attack\nand applies a debuff that increases\ndamage taken by 25%\nto the target for 5 seconds."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000085
    m_Localized: "Crit Damage  +10%\nCan be upgraded any number of times"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000086
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord Effect\nDeploys a field with a radius of n meters\ncentered on Symphony.\n\nInside the field, critical hits\non targets deal\nn times critical damage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000087
    m_Localized: "Attack  +6.25%\nCan be upgraded any number of times"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000088
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord Effect\nGrants damage reduction of s%\nfor up to n hits (does not stack)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000089
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord Effect\nPerforms a 3-beat attack and infects\nthe target and enemies around it.\n\nInfected\nAttacking an infected enemy deals\nn% of the damage to every other\ninfected enemy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000090
    m_Localized: "Kill Chord Effect\nGrants yourself \"recover 10% of damage dealt\"\nfor n seconds (cap per hit: 5)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000091
    m_Localized: "Unlock Points"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000092
    m_Localized: "Mod Points"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000093
    m_Localized: "Episode 11: \"Malice\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000094
    m_Localized: "Break through the mysterious Subject 14 and the Federation's troops."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000095
    m_Localized: "Test Scene"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000096
    m_Localized: "Episode 5: \"The Project\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000097
    m_Localized: "Search the administrative district covertly, infiltrate the camp, and sweep out the enemy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000098
    m_Localized: "Episode 9: \"Echoes\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000099
    m_Localized: "Dodge the enemy's gunfire and force your way through the charging Federation soldiers."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000100
    m_Localized: "Episode 8: \"Scout\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000101
    m_Localized: "Infiltrate the western sector of the administrative district and destroy the enemy to obtain classified intel."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000102
    m_Localized: "Episode 7: \"Respite\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000103
    m_Localized: "Hide from the Federation soldiers, resupply, and eliminate the enemy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000104
    m_Localized: "Episode 12: \"Finale\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000105
    m_Localized: "Defeat Subject 14, the enemy who looks just like Symphony."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000106
    m_Localized: "Episode 3: \"Assault\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000107
    m_Localized: "Annihilate the enemy to expose the full picture of Kapellmeister."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000108
    m_Localized: "Episode 6: \"Doubt\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000109
    m_Localized: "Break through the Federation soldiers bearing down on you to seize new intel."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000110
    m_Localized: "Episode 4: \"Infiltration\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000111
    m_Localized: "Pull off a HALO jump, infiltrate the central administrative district, and defeat the Federation army."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000112
    m_Localized: "Episode 2: \"Revenge\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000113
    m_Localized: "While the infiltration team is at work, wipe out the Federation army that appeared at the forward base."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000114
    m_Localized: "Episode 10: \"Reunion\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000115
    m_Localized: "Scout the eastern sector of the administrative district and crush the enemy to steal classified intel."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000116
    m_Localized: "On the Artificial Human Project 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000117
    m_Localized: "The \"Artificial Human Project\": a program to create enhanced humans, carried out from 1967 to 1989. It produced many test subjects, starting with Subject 0, and had gone as far as beginning mass production."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000118
    m_Localized: "On the Artificial Human Project 2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000119
    m_Localized: "The project was going well and was one step away from military deployment. But when the Federation faced collapse, the laboratory was closed and the project ended. As a result, it was decided that every subject, from the mass-produced units to the Numbers, would be disposed of."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000120
    m_Localized: "On ZeroDivide 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000121
    m_Localized: "\"ZeroDivide, the private military company.\" Founded by Subject 1, Triad, it is a mercenary group made up of the thirteen subjects of the \"Artificial Human Project.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000122
    m_Localized: "On ZeroDivide 2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000123
    m_Localized: "Their goals were revenge on and the destruction of \"Kapellmeister, the secret society,\" and to make the world accept them, artificial humans, as human."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000124
    m_Localized: "On Kapellmeister 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000125
    m_Localized: "\"Kapellmeister, the secret society.\" A secret foundation made up of some high-ranking Federation officials and the former researchers of the \"Artificial Human Project,\" scheming to recreate the \"Conductor Project.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000126
    m_Localized: "On Kapellmeister 2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000127
    m_Localized: "Seeking military applications, they plot to capture the former subjects to revive the project, but they have yet to succeed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000128
    m_Localized: "On Subject 0 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000129
    m_Localized: "Subject 0, who died in an accident during an experiment, was the first subject created by the \"Artificial Human Project\" and the progenitor of every artificial human made after her."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000130
    m_Localized: "On Subject 0 2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000131
    m_Localized: "The other subjects held her in deep affection, trust, and respect. Even now that she is gone, that has not changed; she is still dearly loved."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000132
    m_Localized: "On Subject 13 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000133
    m_Localized: "After Subject 0 died, the researchers, fearing their research would decline, decided to produce a clone of her body."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000134
    m_Localized: "On Subject 13 2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000135
    m_Localized: "Built as a clone of the first subject, Subject 0, was serial number \"Subject 13.\" That was Symphony."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000136
    m_Localized: "On the Orphanage 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000137
    m_Localized: "There was once an orphanage on the outskirts of Neberisk. But the sound of the piano and the children living happily alongside their housemother are there no more."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000138
    m_Localized: "On the Orphanage 2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000139
    m_Localized: "On the open land there is only a wide lot scattered with rubble, and the small back of a mechanical girl gazing at it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000140
    m_Localized: "On the Laboratory Uprising 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000141
    m_Localized: "With the laboratory's closure, the subjects were to be disposed of. Sensing this, on the day before the closure they planned a coordinated armed uprising."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000142
    m_Localized: "On the Laboratory Uprising 2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000143
    m_Localized: "They barricaded themselves inside the laboratory, escaped, and then founded \"ZeroDivide, the private military company.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000144
    m_Localized: "On the Motorcycle 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000145
    m_Localized: "After the armed uprising, Symphony fled east alone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000146
    m_Localized: "On the Motorcycle 2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000147
    m_Localized: "Later, taken in by the orphanage, she rode across the land astride the IZ-49 motorcycle, a machine far removed from her girlish looks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000148
    m_Localized: "On the Conductor Project 1"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000149
    m_Localized: "The \"Conductor Project.\" Drafted by the Federation government in 1962, it was a program to develop soldiers who could operate in environments contaminated by nuclear war."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000150
    m_Localized: "On the Conductor Project 2"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000151
    m_Localized: "At the time, the project was never realized and fell apart. But now, \"Kapellmeister, the secret society\" has restarted it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
